					<meta name="Description" content="I get wanting to support as many languages as possible, but using AI is not the way, guys. The translations will be utterly useless and miss key context of the original text, it's also downright insulting to people who need those languages, if you can't afford to hire translators who will do a good job then don't bother.">
			
