		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_570427327012457795">
		Why AI?	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_570427327012457795">
		I get wanting to support as many languages as possible, but using AI is not the way, guys. The translations will be utterly useless and miss key context of the original text, it's also downright insulting to people who need those languages, if you can't afford to hire translators who will do a good job then don't bother.	</div>
		
	<div class="forum_op_footer">
		<div></div>
			</div>
</div>
<div data-featuretarget="community-awards"></div>
<script type="text/javascript">
	$J( function() {
		InitializeForumTopic( {"owner":"46536274","type":"General","feature":"0","gidforum":"591818032096020774","forum_display_name":"General Discussions","forum_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/5335510\/discussions\/0\/","forum_search_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/5335510\/discussions\/search\/","is_public":1,"permissions":{"can_view":1,"can_post":1,"can_reply":1,"is_banned":0,"can_delete":0,"can_edit":0},"appid":5335510}, "https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/forum\/46536274\/General\/",
		"570427327012457795", {"author":"Cadence Squirrel","text":"I get wanting to support as many languages as possible, but using AI is not the way, guys. The translations will be utterly useless and miss key context of the original text, it's also downright insulting to people who need those languages, if you can't afford to hire translators who will do a good job then don't bother."}		);
			} );
</script>
										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791476057682_591818032096020774_570427327012457795", {"feature":"591818032096020774","feature2":"570427327012457795","owner":"103582791476057682","commentthreadid":"661416822","total_count":37,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":110890513,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":5335510,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"570427327012458541":{"text":"have you tried to volunteer as a free translator?","author":"r_Sh4d0w"},"570427327012459672":{"text":"[quote=r_Sh4d0w;570427327012458541]have you tried to volunteer as a free translator? [\/quote]\nI would if I could. Best I could help with would be script writing.","author":"Cadence Squirrel"},"570427327012460432":{"text":"[quote=Cadence Squirrel;570427327012459672][quote=r_Sh4d0w;570427327012458541]have you tried to volunteer as a free translator? [\/quote]\nI would if I could. Best I could help with would be script writing. [\/quote]\nWhy can't you volunteer? You're the one with an issue about a small dev team of just [b]two people[\/b] using AI to assist them, which I think is a bit rubbish of you. So if you have such a big issue about this, why can't you pitch in and help them with the translation?","author":"fearthesloth"},"570427327012460969":{"text":"[quote=fearthesloth;570427327012460432][quote=Cadence Squirrel;570427327012459672]\nI would if I could. Best I could help with would be script writing. [\/quote]\nWhy can't you volunteer? You're the one with an issue about a small dev team of just [b]two people[\/b] using AI to assist them, which I think is a bit rubbish of you. So if you have such a big issue about this, why can't you pitch in and help them with the translation? [\/quote]\nBeing a small team is no excuse for being lazy and half-assing things like localisations which some people need to even play the game. If you actually put the effort into finding people you can find real talented translators who will volunteer or work cheaply, using AI is just lazy and is an insult to the people who genuinely need translations, we don't put up with shitty dubs, why should we put up with lazy AI translations in a paid game?","author":"Cadence Squirrel"},"570427327012461342":{"text":"Thankfully you don't speak for everyone.  If I had the choice between playing a game using AI translations, which will 99% of the time be good enough to play the game with, or not playing the game at all or atleast not understand the words at all, I'd rather play a good game that might not be perfectly translated.\n\nCan't exactly rely on volunteer translators, which take a lot of work to manage them, and those people who need translations?  There aren't enough of them to justify hiring a translator.","author":"Nedrith"},"570427327012461407":{"text":"[quote=Nedrith;570427327012461342]Thankfully you don't speak for everyone.  If I had the choice between playing a game using AI translations, which will 99% of the time be good enough to play the game with, or not playing the game at all or atleast not understand the words at all, I'd rather play a good game that might not be perfectly translated.\n\nCan't exactly rely on volunteer translators, which take a lot of work to manage them, and those people who need translations?  There aren't enough of them to justify hiring a translator. [\/quote]\nIt must be nice having low standards.","author":"Cadence Squirrel"},"570427327012461677":{"text":"I disagree. I think being a small team of just two people is absolutely fine, and makes using productivity tools like AI a no brainer. I also don't agree that makes the devs \"lazy\". But judging by the aggressive and judgmental language you use, you clearly have a strong issue about this, and frankly you're just coming off as a troll and a grumpy little boy. So be angry with the devs for a wonky and short-sighted reason, but you just like look like a fool.","author":"fearthesloth"},"568175573451407546":{"text":"oohhhh no AI cry cry cry cry cry cry cry cry cry cry cry cry","author":"Sam K"},"568175573451409727":{"text":"People just constantly want to cry about AI now. It's getting old. It's here, it's not going away. It is what it is. Translating is like the most mild, practical, inoffensive form of it. You're going to have trouble adapting if this upsets you.","author":"JoshG"},"568175573451409947":{"text":"I agree, using AI for translation is really stupid. And for the AI stans out there, the actual problem with using AI translation is that it's less refined and uses far more physical resources than the computer-assisted translation tools we already have, and have used for decades. \n\nAI translators have been systemically overpromising what they can deliver vs using traditional CAT with it's multiple decades worth of translation memories and glossaries and centuries of references. They are shoe-horning themselves into a field that they are not only not ready for, but actively stealing source reference from. That's it.","author":"Archernar"},"568175573451409970":{"text":"AI will do a much better job of translation than any human. Its the ideal task for AI.","author":"Electron"},"568175573451410990":{"text":"AI cry, please pay him some attention","author":"cacahuete"},"568175573451412321":{"text":"Here's a challenge for the OP, without using a translation app rewrite your original post in as many different languages as you can. \n\nEnglish only counts once!","author":"Mr. Fibble"},"568175573451412328":{"text":"[quote=Cadence Squirrel;570427327012459672][quote=r_Sh4d0w;570427327012458541]have you tried to volunteer as a free translator? [\/quote]\nI would if I could. Best I could help with would be script writing. [\/quote]\nreach out to them on discord, the channels are extremely active","author":"GameOverRIP"},"568175573451469887":{"text":"[quote=Asgard;568175573451427425][quote=Cadence Squirrel;570427327012461407]\nIt must be nice having low standards. [\/quote]\n\nI mean it worked for your mum she settled for the first and easiest option.\n\nThen they both thought, Sure lets keep the brain dead incell, after all a pumpkin made it to president.\n\nMake your own game get it certified and THEN you have a voice until then put daddies toes back in your mouth so you dont say something stupid again. [\/quote]\nI'm a femcel, I'll have you know.","author":"Cadence Squirrel"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
