			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_570427327012460432">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c570427327012459672">Cadence Squirrel</a></b>:</div><blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c570427327012458541">r_Sh4d0w</a></b>:</div>have you tried to volunteer as a free translator? </blockquote>I would if I could. Best I could help with would be script writing. </blockquote>Why can't you volunteer? You're the one with an issue about a small dev team of just <b>two people</b> using AI to assist them, which I think is a bit rubbish of you. So if you have such a big issue about this, why can't you pitch in and help them with the translation?			</div>
